  "$comment": "The fixed rhythm (redesign-spec § 1.2; tokens v2, S-167): spacing, type scale, control sizes, shadows, z-index, motion and the page grid. `type` is the v2 type roles of the locked direction (docs/design/revamp-epic.md: body 14, meta 12, card titles 13.5, page titles 24) and `density` its marketplace density (5 results a row at 1280, 7 a rail, a 224 px filter rail, a 12 px photo-well inset). Not part of the brand: a rebrand cannot change it.",
